<title>NORWAY: Saga signs rig deal with Ocean Rig.</title>
<headline>Saga signs rig deal with Ocean Rig.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian rig group Ocean Rig ASA said on Monday it had signed a memorandum of agreement with Saga Petroleum ASA for the contracting of its first fifth generation drilling rig under construction at the Dalian New Shipyard in China.</p>
<p>The contract period will be between five and eight years from the summer of 1999.</p>
<p>Ocean Rig said the deal was worth $330 million over a five-year period and $490 million over eight years.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
